### List agents
GET http://localhost:5000/api/agents?page=1&limit=10

### Search agents
GET http://localhost:5000/api/agents?q=Aarav

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/agents/agents-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diya Patel",
  "email": "diya@example.com",
  "agency": "Mumbai Events Co",
  "commissionPct": 15,
  "active": true
}
